msgctxt "scenario:scenario_28D6040B_1653_440E_9709_DD0BF42A7F92"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫Hahh, ⟪k:19⟫hah... ⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫haahh!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫――はあっ、⟪k:19⟫は、⟪k:20⟫……はあ……！"

#: scenario:scenario_76414AD9_CBC2_4E2D_9A48_5BD226AF7166
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78c1b2c41a2a94eb715024952239609c6f328737b1950549575c6c4428699043
#. default-sha256: ca5430f4e4f19f467ca25268ce3e69d231b77a13c77d291a77c083262713ad5e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_76414AD9_CBC2_4E2D_9A48_5BD226AF7166"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In a fevered frenzy, Mell fled from the mansion. ⟪k:1⟫Even in early summer, the night was "
"cold."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫メルは衝動に任せて、⟪k:1⟫逃げるように屋敷を後にしました。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫初夏とはいえ、⟪k:4⟫夜は寒"
"いものです。"

#: scenario:scenario_6801AEDC_0747_46BB_8CFE_962228550A8F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5246b6e602771b57dfb587a1a922df135cd858d9c2ea1ccd03d36a7320daa8c2
#. default-sha256: a79e3086c55197e5e50bfd139bd8b4ce739f11c66a02de3c2225a05f889efa52
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6801AEDC_0747_46BB_8CFE_962228550A8F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And to make matters worse, raindrops pelted him from head to toe."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫更に彼の全身を叩きつけるのは、⟪k:1⟫鋭い雨粒。"

#: scenario:scenario_CCA9673A_482B_43E1_A63C_1E2C96681A1F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9d11fe5cecbf3ae39684097b2020d69739156d77817cea02f4c78cdbd19b993
#. default-sha256: 3c19ddc25fb37dca4144c5cd63bb58adb5f48e0a2a32fcd277ba736881e9abc9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CCA9673A_482B_43E1_A63C_1E2C96681A1F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that caused him little discomfort, for a far greater maelstrom of pain rampaged within "
"his breast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫しかしそれが苦痛だと、⟪k:1⟫彼には思えませんでした。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫本当の苦しみは心の中で渦巻いてい"
"るんですもの。"

#: scenario:scenario_140790A3_031E_46EE_A5A9_C09D5D593EE8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a2ce136d905d2b7f9fd2a5490e844c4faacee276e2ca15d847fd6a66b82a42e
#. default-sha256: 9eb9fbd7670c7ccef3bc4ebda6524bddfe0671cb43879b2ba6acda5f7399c7e6
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_140790A3_031E_46EE_A5A9_C09D5D593EE8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At night, the town took on a different appearance. ⟪k:1⟫Not simply for lack of illumination, "
"but the people active within it as well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫夜の街は、⟪k:1⟫昼間とは顔を変えますわ。⟪k:2⟫単に灯りが無いだけでなく、⟪k:3⟫そこに息づく人間そ"
"のものが違ってしまったように。"

#: scenario:scenario_5678B376_21F6_4AA4_B7F2_5DAE02514F57
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b447e649597dfdcfa80bb6e7d59fcaab8805aed19a9bd56c850c220526e90f4
#. default-sha256: 2b5b21991eba5ddca80f50e710491452fcced8e8ddd99ae3481f4f44dc1ad297
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5678B376_21F6_4AA4_B7F2_5DAE02514F57"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was not a suitable place for a young aristocratic man to go wandering unattended."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫貴族の青年が、⟪k:1⟫無暗に出歩けるような街ではないのです。"

#: scenario:scenario_320635AE_966E_4446_B2EE_B0BF550649BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9d41be77601fc39da0f290abdb9bfbe7dfc3c4b5c9376f013a393451db353ea
#. default-sha256: 773141f91a3a4a4fba15468415bf08f9eeb4a6ad0b0caca11c3d1ae655357408
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_320635AE_966E_4446_B2EE_B0BF550649BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The darkness is not only the abode of devils, but of beggars, thieves, criminals, and all "
"manner of things undesirable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫暗闇は悪魔を呼ぶだけでなく、⟪k:1⟫物乞い、⟪k:2⟫夜盗、⟪k:3⟫犯罪者、⟪k:4⟫ありとあらゆる負の存在"
"を、⟪k:5⟫集めるのですから。"

#: scenario:scenario_CE475EBF_25A7_4D0A_8CA6_D1F696B6A135
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49321fb227bcdac98edaf4379bf6c6a68c1131bb0e4a5b2460da32aa857fff83
#. default-sha256: f8e757579e61537e984ae3d6e3d0fbd98a11ac57df40199ed4e71b34d156e002
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CE475EBF_25A7_4D0A_8CA6_D1F696B6A135"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………ッ！"

#: scenario:scenario_7C893E1F_346E_4C9F_B42E_D76879C2965A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55789d925db57af6362ea531531a68c2bd21f76fc65d57a697485f70e977764c
#. default-sha256: 4e782bc90d1f5a763ef410cdc55a7a61aa32a76ea4abf2270eb085820c1d06f2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7C893E1F_346E_4C9F_B42E_D76879C2965A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But despite that, he continued to run, knowing not where he was to head."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それでも彼は構わずに走り続けました。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫彼自身、⟪k:3⟫どこへ向かえばいいのか、⟪k:4⟫分"
"かっていなかったはずです。"

#: scenario:scenario_7007E2B4_607A_4FF5_8C31_8FF521D1D873
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d31fdbe3ab3c4d337d76327eed8b5084270bdf0135bc580645cf67bfcc65173
#. default-sha256: df5ab380b44e8aa3cefbbf52f3f00ecf55887b9f0548b781cf59f85980341dcd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7007E2B4_607A_4FF5_8C31_8FF521D1D873"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He simply went where his feet took him. ⟪k:1⟫And where he arrived was the church."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ただ、⟪k:1⟫足の向くままに任せていたのですわ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫そして結局――⟪k:4⟫辿り着いたのは、⟪k:5⟫"
"教会の入り口でした。"

#: scenario:scenario_A737D17B_7F90_44CE_BBCC_E5F99BB3C160
