msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Not her lies, but the truth!)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（あんな嘘だらけの言葉じゃなくて、⟪k:1⟫本当のことを……！）"

#: scenario:scenario_79061396_354A_4D72_852F_7D33E819F438
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00f7d87cd554eaf50118b0478c506e7c2c898f8db6cb7b427ae878ff8426ea7d
