#: scenario:scenario_9C0B4BD0_A326_4AAF_9A1E_428235FC6D1A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 645ee750d2edc8299ae20c133a99e4b7403538ec1722bbc1c05235ac3cbbeac3
#. default-sha256: 87722299dc94bd5655f1c9e1766749da234ea8046cdf959745f634d6f0110908
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9C0B4BD0_A326_4AAF_9A1E_428235FC6D1A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But as you might expect, the door was locked, and the priest showed no sign of responding to "
"his calls. ⟪k:1⟫The sound of the pouring rain drowned out everything else."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫しかし当然ながら、⟪k:1⟫教会の扉は閉まっておりました。⟪k:2⟫神父が顔を出す気配もありません。"
"⟪k:3⟫ただ、⟪k:4⟫強い雨の音だけが支配しているのです。"

#: scenario:scenario_79338D90_4BD2_43EF_B5AB_E1A8DE245487
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 215ee7d2cd044069a178e629cbcfa06b349c3109b673ba14e4a9be06e6da2433
#. default-sha256: 359f603e531447b0994e1fff10c0f2e68c064bacfaaafc2f9a43597c14dd9af2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_79338D90_4BD2_43EF_B5AB_E1A8DE245487"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nnh..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……ッ、⟪k:1⟫……。"

#: scenario:scenario_A9C0F767_79A2_4DB6_92EC_132010EF2A30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c37e5930226c9762cbb4da48445fd57b3beadcd9f75857d2fa0142292e9ee262
#. default-sha256: 7ae851329af37d31afb49a6637252a6cc69ce00ee6744a7958477b9cbbb157aa
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A9C0F767_79A2_4DB6_92EC_132010EF2A30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His head drooped feebly. ⟪k:1⟫He looked like a helpless little calf who had wandered, alone, "
"onto a dark, precarious mountain path with no end in sight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼は力なく項垂れました。⟪k:1⟫まるでその姿は、⟪k:2⟫先の見えない隘路に潜り込んでしまったよう"
"な、⟪k:3⟫一匹のか弱い子牛ではありませんか。"

#: scenario:scenario_8EAD7373_0AA2_4954_ACE6_8051992CE92A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08b7348378bfeda178220906f28957136e13a47277d8153dfd52c2ec90e22911
#. default-sha256: 60fc92409c181fb4b8f01ebd3d40bc165b5b84ab40e52f136f5dd7896889faf7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8EAD7373_0AA2_4954_ACE6_8051992CE92A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どうして………。"

#: scenario:scenario_6ED4B62B_E12E_4D5B_8D73_7EE2BC667616
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 857c386e073e317b60e8ae092f22c31d913476baada8ed825a77afeda596e0d5
#. default-sha256: fb4a6da372bf53df5b03673540632b3edd9963eba14c24bf67d956a5c37ca7c0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6ED4B62B_E12E_4D5B_8D73_7EE2BC667616"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Why won’t anyone tell me the truth?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All I want... ⟪k:3⟫All I want is for someone to "
"tell me it’s not true!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫どうして……誰も、⟪k:1⟫僕に本当のことを教えてくれないんだ……。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫僕は、⟪k:4⟫僕は、⟪k:5⟫た"
"だ一言、⟪k:6⟫違うと……その言葉だけを……！！"

#: scenario:scenario_C00DCF2D_6774_43CE_9214_83D0559ACD6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6e95558bbb5a2475458426e57569343e31531484290de0113210c51699437dd
#. default-sha256: 0daa924bb6cc7552645d9be335adb5cc67d45e98f09014f1fe13f34f96cb9491
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C00DCF2D_6774_43CE_9214_83D0559ACD6E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Have I sinned?!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No, I didn’t know anything!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I didn’t know—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫僕は罪を犯していたのか……？⟪k:1⟫　違う、⟪k:2⟫僕は何も知らなかったんだ！⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫僕は何も……！"

#: scenario:scenario_7676B9E7_B6A6_4D27_9D66_080D85ADA4E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f17ca828c380154c729888f8b6c2d884e329df4bb4c2b6e3fb0dd28877993101
#. default-sha256: 2db1370d7583ff23f61432ec84b98dd7bb28d1cf8b43e86f0a6d6b085d6d58ea
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7676B9E7_B6A6_4D27_9D66_080D85ADA4E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No... ⟪k:1⟫No... ⟪k:2⟫None of it’s true...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫So I... ⟪k:5⟫I haven’t done anything "
